use new_linked_list_with, append, remove_first, size_of, is_empty, clear from "std:linked_list"
constant ll is the result of new_linked_list_with 1
size_of ll
say it
is_empty ll
say it
append ll with 2
size_of ll
say it
remove_first ll
remove_first ll
size_of ll
say it
is_empty ll
say it
append ll with 9
clear ll
is_empty ll
say it
